WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
What if remembering more made you notice something unexpected?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Participants held one digit or six
while comparing two lines.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A surprise appeared once.
Higher load improved detection in this task.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
That's not an instruction to multitask.
Attention depends on the task.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
No branded meditation audio was tested
in that experiment.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try a free routine. Inspect the evidence.
Decide without a miracle claim.
